Thanks for your kind reply. I knew I couldn't use CODEX with that settings, although I had only those 3 samples ran with the same kit, so I hadn't much of a choice. Thanks anyways!

Switching Topic, I'm now using the targeted script you provided on a set of targeted resequencing  bams (38 samples). I sorted my bed and collapsed all overlapping exons.
 Iam then trying to run the cmds provided by your script. However, during normalization, the following error occur:

> > qcObj=qc(Y,sampname,chr,ref,mapp,gc,cov_thresh=c(60,4000),length_thresh=c(20,2000),mapp_thresh=0.9,gc_thresh=c(20,80))
