>
>
the cmd should be around line 100 of your original script.  I'm wrapping my head around this although I can't find a solution to it. Any hint on that?

I attached you also the script I'm running, as well as my R session and my BED file (the R session is the coverage breakpoint).

Again, thanks!

Daniele

